; Anomaly Coop - callback routes of the core group (W4), read by the engine after configs\coop_route.ltx (same
; sections and rules, see there). Migrated from coop_domains_core.ltx (F2 T10).
;
; The core group's own scripts (coop_core_*) are view through coop_* in coop_route.ltx: they run on every machine and
; decide by role themselves.
; Stock scripts the core scripts depend on keep their main-file rule: ui_mutant_loot (view, ui_*: the client asks the
; host before its loot window opens), game_statistics / actor_status_thirst / actor_status_sleep (owner: the client's
; own values, kept by the host through coop_core_player), treasure_manager and dynamic_news_manager (host: clients get
; stash content and news from the host through coop_core_world). trade_manager has no rule: its handlers follow their
; callbacks (clients only apply trade profiles through coop_core_world).

; FDDA (Food, Drug and Drink Animations, third party, only if installed): item-use animations of the local actor.
; Its HUD animation prefetch is switched off on clients by coop_core_world.
[route_scripts]
enhanced_animations          = owner
ea_*                         = owner
